            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "‘फिर से शुरू करें’ दबाएँ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Resume on the same line." : {
      "comment" : "Help, under 'Location stopped'. Resume is the button on that line.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "उसी लाइन पर ‘फिर से शुरू करें’ दबाएँ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the line. It opens Settings to turn it on." : {
      "comment" : "Help, under 'Location off or Precise Location off': tapping that line on Tracking opens the app's page in Settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "लाइन पर टैप करें। सेटिंग खुलेगी, वहाँ इसे चालू करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to fix" : {
      "comment" : "Problem line, after 'Location off' or 'Precise Location off': tapping the line opens the app's page in Settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ठीक करने के लिए टैप करें"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap your run" : {
      "comment" : "Tip on 'Choose a run', pointing at the run under way: its title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "अपने फेरे पर टैप करें"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app closed while this trip was running. Reports are paused until you choose." : {
      "comment" : "Under the Resume screen's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ट्रिप चलते समय ऐप बंद हो गया। जब तक आप कुछ नहीं चुनते, रिपोर्ट रुकी रहेंगी।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app needs these to report vehicle %@. iOS asks about each one next." : {
      "comment" : "Under the checklist's title: the vehicle's fleet number, e.g. 'The app needs these to report vehicle 4317. iOS asks about each one next.'",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "गाड़ी %@ की रिपोर्ट भेजने के लिए ऐप को ये चाहिए। iOS आगे हर एक के बारे में पूछेगा।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iPhone is finding its position." : {
      "comment" : "Help, under 'Waiting for GPS'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone अपनी लोकेशन ढूँढ रहा है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The next driver can sign in on this phone." : {
      "comment" : "Under 'Sign out?'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "अगला ड्राइवर इस फ़ोन पर साइन इन कर सकता है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The number on the sign" : {
      "comment" : "Welcome, screen 2: under 'Choose a route'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "बोर्ड पर लिखा नंबर"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The number on the vehicle" : {
      "comment" : "Welcome, screen 2: under 'Choose your vehicle'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "गाड़ी पर लिखा नंबर"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The schedule has no routes" : {
      "comment" : "Empty state title when the server's schedule lists no routes.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "शेड्यूल में कोई रूट नहीं है"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The schedule moved on to a new day." : {
      "comment" : "Banner when the server refused a start because the run is not in service on the day it now resolves to.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "शेड्यूल अगले दिन पर चला गया है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen stays on while it charges" : {
      "comment" : "Welcome, screen 3: under 'Keep the phone on charge'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "चार्ज होते समय स्क्रीन चालू रहती है"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server didn't confirm the end. Check your signal and try again, or stop reporting on this phone now." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the 'Trip not ended yet' alert.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "सर्वर ने ट्रिप खत्म होने की पुष्टि नहीं की। अपना सिग्नल जाँचें और फिर से कोशिश करें, या अभी इस फ़ोन पर रिपोर्ट भेजना बंद करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server didn't confirm the trip ended. Try again, or end it on this phone only." : {
      "comment" : "Banner on the Resume screen once the server did not confirm the end; the buttons then say Try again and End on this phone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "सर्वर ने ट्रिप खत्म होने की पुष्टि नहीं की। फिर से कोशिश करें, या इसे सिर्फ़ इस फ़ोन पर खत्म करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is not taking this vehicle's reports. Ask your dispatcher." : {
      "comment" : "Help, under 'Reports refused'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "सर्वर इस गाड़ी की रिपोर्ट नहीं ले रहा। कंट्रोल रूम से पूछें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server's reply could not be read." : {
      "comment" : "Shown only where no screen has its own words for a reply the app could not read, such as a Wi-Fi sign-in page answering in place of the server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "सर्वर का जवाब पढ़ा नहीं जा सका।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then tap %@" : {
      "comment" : "Welcome, screen 2: under 'Choose a run'. The name of the button that starts a trip, filled in from that button, e.g. 'Then tap Start trip'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "फिर ‘%@’ दबाएँ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then tap %@. Riders see your vehicle from then on." : {
      "comment" : "Tip on 'Choose a run', under its title. The name of the start confirmation's button that starts the trip, filled in from that button, e.g. 'Then tap Start trip. Riders see your vehicle from then on.'",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "फिर %@ दबाएँ। उसके बाद यात्री आपकी गाड़ी देख सकते हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This link does not contain a server address the app can use." : {
      "comment" : "Title of the setup link alert when the link names no server address the app may use.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "इस लिंक में ऐसा सर्वर पता नहीं है जिसे ऐप इस्तेमाल कर सके।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This number grows while riders can see you. With no signal, keep driving." : {
      "comment" : "Tip on the trip bar's sent count, under its title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "जब तक यात्री आपको देख सकते हैं, यह नंबर बढ़ता रहता है। सिग्नल न हो, तो गाड़ी चलाते रहें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phone is signed in to %@. The link was not used." : {
      "comment" : "Title of the setup link alert when the phone is already signed in, so it keeps its server: the host of that server, e.g. 'This phone is signed in to tracker.example.org. The link was not used.'",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "यह फ़ोन %@ में साइन इन है। लिंक इस्तेमाल नहीं हुआ।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This run has no route or stops to follow. Pick another run." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal when the run's geometry has no shape or no stops to judge adherence against.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "इस फेरे में चलने के लिए कोई रूट या स्टॉप नहीं है। कोई दूसरा फेरा चुनें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three riders at a stop can see your vehicle coming." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: the picture on the welcome's first screen, a vehicle on its route, riders waving at the next stop and a rider's phone showing the vehicle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "स्टॉप पर खड़े तीन यात्री आपकी गाड़ी को आते हुए देख सकते हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To %@" : {
      "comment" : "A segment of the direction switch over the run board; the argument is the headsign most of that direction's runs show, e.g. 'To Downtown Seattle'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ की ओर"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too many tries. Wait a minute, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Banner above the sign-in button when the server refused for too many attempts; its window is one minute.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "बहुत बार कोशिश हो गई। एक मिनट रुकें, फिर से कोशिश करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trip" : {
      "comment" : "CarPlay: the title of the trip's Details screen, and its row with the headsign and the run's start time, e.g. 'Downtown Seattle · 6:58 AM'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ट्रिप"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Trip not ended yet" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the alert shown when the server did not confirm the end of the trip.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ट्रिप अभी खत्म नहीं हुई"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again" : {
      "comment" : "Button in the 'Trip not ended yet' alert, and on the Resume screen after a failed end: send the end again.\nButton that retries a load or a start that failed.\nChecklist row button: ask iOS for precise location again, or check Location Services again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "फिर से कोशिश करें"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on automatic time in Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Help, under 'Phone clock is wrong'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "सेटिंग में समय अपने-आप सेट होना चालू करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Under the card" : {
      "comment" : "Help: the heading over the lines that can show under the status card on Tracking, and the card that takes its place when signed out.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "कार्ड के नीचे"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use %@?" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the alert a setup link from the agency opens, which fills in the server on the sign-in screen once the driver agrees. The server's host, e.g. 'Use tracker.example.org?'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ इस्तेमाल करें?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use https://. Plain http:// is allowed only for localhost, 127.0.0.1 or a .local host." : {
      "comment" : "Under the server field when the address is plain http to a host the app won't send a password to.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "https:// इस्तेमाल करें। सादा http:// सिर्फ़ localhost, 127.0.0.1 या .local होस्ट के लिए चलता है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use iPhone to see more" : {
      "comment" : "CarPlay: the last row of a list the car cut short; the rest of the list is on the phone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "और देखने के लिए iPhone इस्तेमाल करें"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use this server" : {
      "comment" : "Setup link alert: the button that fills in the link's server on the sign-in screen.",
      "localizations" : {
