          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GPS का इंतज़ार। %1$@ से, %2$@ वाला फेरा, गाड़ी %3$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you finish" : {
      "comment" : "Welcome, screen 2: beside a picture of the End trip button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "काम पूरा होने पर"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you finish, %@." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver: the welcome's last row on screen 2, 'When you finish', then the name of the End trip button it pictures, filled in from that button, e.g. 'When you finish, End trip.'",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "काम पूरा होने पर, %@।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With CarPlay. Reports start when you open the app." : {
      "comment" : "Help, under 'Open the app on iPhone': the line shows when a trip started from the car cannot report until the app is opened on the phone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "CarPlay से शुरू हुई ट्रिप में, ऐप खोलते ही रिपोर्ट शुरू हो जाती हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrong email or password. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Under the password field when the server turned the email and password down.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ईमेल या पासवर्ड गलत है। फिर से कोशिश करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You already have a trip running. End it before starting another." : {
      "comment" : "Banner when the server refused a start because the driver already has a trip running.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आपकी एक ट्रिप पहले से चल रही है। दूसरी शुरू करने से पहले उसे खत्म करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are on the timetable." : {
      "comment" : "Help, under 'On time'.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आप टाइम टेबल के हिसाब से चल रहे हैं।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're not assigned to vehicle %@." : {
      "comment" : "Banner when the server refused a start because the driver is not assigned to the vehicle: the fleet number, e.g. 'You're not assigned to vehicle 4317.'",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "गाड़ी %@ आपको नहीं दी गई है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agency sets the server on this phone." : {
      "comment" : "Title of the setup link alert when the agency's device management sets the server, so the link was not used.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "इस फ़ोन पर सर्वर आपकी एजेंसी सेट करती है।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your agency's server setting is not a valid address, so type it here." : {
      "comment" : "Under the server field when the agency's device management set a server the app can't use.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आपकी एजेंसी की सर्वर सेटिंग में सही पता नहीं है, इसलिए उसे यहाँ टाइप करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your previous trip could not be ended yet. Check your connection and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal when the end of a trip ended on this phone only could not be sent before the next start.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आपकी पिछली ट्रिप अभी खत्म नहीं हो सकी। अपना कनेक्शन जाँचें और फिर से कोशिश करें।"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your trip is still open" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the card at the top of the sign-in-again sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "आपकी ट्रिप अभी खुली है"
